Manage_Integration_Concrete_Test
├── single-call form
│  ├── when caller not authorized
│  │  └── it should revert with Unauthorized
│  └── when caller authorized
│     ├── when target selector not granted to caller
│     │  └── it should revert with TargetMethodNotAuthorized
│     └── when target selector granted
│        ├── it should forward calldata to the target (with value)
│        └── it should return the target's return data
└── multi-call form
   ├── when caller not authorized
   │  └── it should revert with Unauthorized
   ├── when target selector not granted to caller for any element
   │  └── it should revert with TargetMethodNotAuthorized
   └── when all target selectors granted
      └── it should forward each calldata to the matching target
